ocess:**\n   - Now, we need to divide 3080 by 314.\n   - Perform the division: \\( 3080 \\div 314 \\approx 9.81 \\).\n\n8. **Write down the next part of the quotient:**\n   - The integer part of the quotient is 9, so we write 9 next to the 1 above the division bar.\n\n9. **Multiply the divisor by the new quotient part:**\n   - Multiply 314 by 9: \\( 314 \\times 9 = 2826 \\).\n\n10. **Subtract this product from the current part of the dividend:**\n    - Subtract 2826 from 3080: \\( 3080 - 2826 = 254 \\).\n\n11. **Since 254 is less than 314, we stop here:**\n    - The remainder is 254, and we stop the division process.\n\nTherefore, the result of 622 divided by 314 is approximately 1.98, or more precisely, 1.981 (when rounded to three decimal places).\n\nSo, the final answer is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{1.981}\n\\]\n</answer>",
