tep by step.\n..\n</think>.\n<answer>.\nTo find the difference between 532 and 843, we align the numbers by their place values and subtract them column by column from right to left:\n```.\n  843\n- 532\n------\n```.\nStarting from the units place:\n```.\n  3\n- 2\n------\n  1\n```.\nNext, we move to the tens place:\n```.\n  4\n- 3\n------\n  1\n```.\nFinally, we move to the hundreds place:\n```.\n  8\n- 5\n------\n  3\n```.\nSo, the difference between 843 and 532 is 311.\nTherefore, my final answer is: 311.\n</answer>",
